# Fast Track / lease upload — never wipe "Your name" before Continue

**Symptom:** Fast Track AI Review **Continue** (or Edit Resident lease **Save**) shows **Enter your name.**

**Causes (either):**
1. Writing `emptyExtractionReview()` / blank `formDraft.extractionReview.account.contactName` into draft/localStorage (profile lease upload path).
2. `normalizeExtractionReview` / `placeAccountAndTenantNames` clearing a non-empty review-form `contactName` (e.g. matches a resident) **before** `validateReviewManualAccount` on Continue.

## Rule

| Action | Required |
|---|---|
| Persist profile lease files | Use `draft_state.residentLeaseDocuments` + `ulo.residentLeaseDocs.{landlordId}` only |
| Matching on profile / Settings | Prefer `extractedPayload` on the file; do not invent an AI review |
| Heal leftover stubs | Strip blank-account review stubs (empty portfolio or profile-only `ext-lease-*-0` rows) |
| Fast Track Continue | Merge review-form account + `accountSetup` + `landlords.contact_name`; after normalize, **preserve** non-empty review `contactName` / SMS consent; then validate |

## Autofix (Bugbot)

On PR review (or when this symptom appears in chat):

1. Stop calling `emptyExtractionReview()` / writing `formDraft.extractionReview` from Edit Resident lease save.
2. Persist uploads under `residentLeaseDocuments` — **not** by rewriting Fast Track `extractionReview`.
3. Do **not** rewrite all of `ulo.landlordOnboarding.{id}` from lease upload. Only delete a blank `formDraft.extractionReview` stub in place.
4. In `commitFastTrackImport`: seed from `review.account` first; after `normalizeExtractionReview`, call `preserveReviewContactName` (or equivalent) so a typed/shown name survives tenant-collision cleanup; **then** `validateReviewManualAccount`.
5. Keep a unit test: normalize clears contact that matches a resident → preserve restores review-form name → validate ok when SMS consent present.
6. Keep `Enter your name.` only on account-setup / AI-review Continue — never throw it from `uploadResidentLeaseDocuments`.

**Note:** Cursor Bugbot Autofix runs on PRs when enabled in the Bugbot dashboard. Agents must apply this rule when the symptom appears in chat or PR.

## Where it lives

- Upload + heal: `src/lib/residentLeaseDocuments.ts` → `uploadResidentLeaseDocuments`
- Archive load (ignore stubs): `src/lib/organizationSettings.ts` → `loadOnboardingDocumentArchive`
- Continue: `src/lib/onboarding/fastTrackImport.ts` → `commitFastTrackImport`
- Preserve + validate: `src/lib/onboardingReviewManual.ts` → `preserveReviewContactName` / `validateReviewManualAccount`
- Placement wipe risk: `shared/onboarding/typedDocumentExtract/placeFields.ts` → `placeAccountAndTenantNames`

## Do not

- Call `emptyExtractionReview()` from profile lease upload
- Validate after normalize without preserving the review-form `contactName`
- Spread-write local onboarding state with only `{ formDraft }` (drops completed status)
- Rely on inventing `extractionReview` leases for profile document matching
